{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7Kqg3XC7DCQkcLrrEA9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft, a few questions. Your answers will change what the pitch says:\n\n1. **Why did the cinema close in 2022, and why will it stay open this time?** Backers will want to know it won't close again. What has changed? For example: free rent, volunteer staff, lower running costs, a budget showing it breaks even at some number of tickets a week.\n2. **Why did the last campaign fall short, and what's different now?** I can see the lower target ($85k vs $120k), the bank's $25k and the 46 volunteers. Was there anything else, like the owner's deal not existing yet or a different plan? Is it all-or-nothing again, with refunds if you miss June 30?\n3. **What do backers get?** Reward tiers, a named seat, founding-member passes, free tickets? Or is it a straight donation, and is it tax-deductible?\n4. **How is the $85,000 split** between projector, sound and roof? Do you have quotes or a contractor lined up, and a target reopening date?\n5. **Names:** the cinema's name, the town, the bank (can it be named?), and who signs the pitch (your name and title?).\n6. **Is there anything a local reader already knows or will find out** that the pitch should address first? For example, why the old operator left, the state of the roof, doubts about the building owner, or leftover feelings from the refund."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":725,"cache_read_input_tokens":9516,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":725},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a1e552e0-f8c3-4ca7-8691-119fd8c80637","uuid":"f5ad34aa-0038-4137-97c6-